Subject: [PATCH] TEACH-FORMSHOW: the Teach page's golden FormShow screen half
 as a display-only second-type bridge (GET /api/form/HW.teach.html) -- ~150
 Visible / TabVisible / Caption / Color / Enabled / ActivePage on this
 machine's real options
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

EastSun 1001 "請檢查每個頁面元件" / "不是只有檢查按鈕喔 我說的是所有元件": the every-component check found that the web Teach
page applied none of golden TfTeach::FormShow's screen assignments (uteach.cpp:1413-2012) -- every OCR / Preciser / laser /
Rotate Kit / Auto Clean / 16-picker / Bin Box / X-Y pitch / Fix3 / AOI panel showed as drawn in uteach.dfm.

* FileRW/TeachFormShow_File.cpp (new, hand-written by gen_formbridge's rule): widget->Prop = rhs -> J.SetProp("widget", rhs),
  control flow and right-hand sides verbatim, every line tagged with its golden line. Not copied, on purpose: the lines that
  change the machine or read files (ReadFile, SetCompomentIO, SetMotorSpeed, fAllMotorHome=false, TriTemp_Teach,
  fAOI_ReadFile, myLog), the data cells the C path already loads (FileRW/Teach.cpp), Tray Z (:1823-1826 / :1844-1855, done by
  page/ht9045_teach_trayz_c.js), and geometry / bevel (Flat, Width, Top). Registered in FileRW/_registry.cpp and
  _formbridge_sources.cmake (marked hand-written, keep when regenerating). save / saveFlow are NULL: form.save answers 405.
* JsonBridge/FormBridge.h/.cpp: FormState gains SetColor (JSON "color":"#rrggbb" from VCL TColor; system colours "sys:0x...")
  and SetActivePage by sheet name (JSON "activePage"), with touched bits. Additive; the HotPlate bridge is unchanged.
* tests/test_teach_formshow_bridge.cpp (ctest TeachFormShowBridge): two option sets, 28 assertions each naming its golden
  line (Preciser / OCR / laser / Auto 4-6 / Fix3 colour + caption / rotate kit / pitch / Axle Control start page / find-phase
  TabSheet10 / grpLoadY / no fMain / no TfTeach -> todo). Optional argv[1] dumps set A as an /api/form answer.

Verified: build_integ_ship_x86_o2 wb_serve 0 errors, new files 0 warnings; TeachFormShowBridge 28/28.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
